{"title":"Venezuela stablecoin fact of the day","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/940061582/0/marginalrevolution~Venezuela-stablecoin-fact-of-the-day.html","date":1768249749000,"content":"<blockquote><p>By one estimate, almost 80% of Venezuela’s oil revenue is collected in stablecoins like tether, a local economist, Asdrúbal Oliveros, said on a <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7vp2v8fKXJg&amp;t=279s\" target=\"_blank\">recent podcast</a>.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wsj.com/finance/currencies/maduros-crypto-backed-oil-deals-put-tether-at-center-of-venezuela-money-drama-3fc53b29?gaa_at=eafs&amp;gaa_n=AWEtsqfzZKjfuGjumRY1Cve0jdYyjXnz5IVs9cYRH_awH9LTr9ocwpWRif2rPDke9lA%3D&amp;gaa_ts=696540ac&amp;gaa_sig=B0Ktk2nESRbGQJGjQxjS9Bgl82Xll-KyqYT4ERuFqY8tqD7bWhJzS01DhM2-VXi2PbNx5xxrGlXGEOxoVyvCXw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\">the full WSJ piece</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/venezuela-stablecoin-fact-of-the-day.html\">Venezuela stablecoin fact of the day</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/940061582/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/940061582/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/940061582/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/940061582/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/940061582/marginal